'''Diana's Bookshelf''' is a {{Rare}} item.

== Obtaining ==
'''Diana's Bookshelf''' can be purchased from the {{Zone|Regalia Room}} for {{c|75m}}. As it is a rotating item, it may not be available every [[SkyBlock Year]].

'''Diana's Bookshelf''' can also be obtained from [[Raffle of the Century]] event.

== Usage ==
The player can keep '''Diana's Bookshelf''' in their inventory to track how many {{Ench|Chimera 1}} books they drop from {{MobSprite|Minos Inquisitor;Minos Inquisitors}}. 

If the player has multiple uncompleted '''Diana's Bookshelves''' in their inventory, only the one with the highest count of books, or in case of a tie, the first one will be incremented.

Finding {{Green|6}} {{Ench|Chimera 1}} books will allow the player to consume the item and gain a permanent stat bonus of the following:  
*{{stat|magic find|+1}}
*{{stat|tracking|+1}}
*{{stat|Taming Wisdom|+1}}

The player may only gain the bonus once.

